$$
\begin{aligned}\lim_{x\rightarrow\infty}\frac{y}{x}&=\lim_{x\rightarrow\infty}\ln\left(2+\frac{1}{x-1}\right)=\ln2,\\\lim_{x\rightarrow\infty}(y-x\ln2)&=\lim_{x\rightarrow\infty}\left[x\ln\left(2+\frac{1}{x-1}\right)-x\ln2\right]=\lim_{x\rightarrow\infty}x\left[\ln\left(2+\frac{1}{x-1}\right)-\ln2\right]\\&=\lim_{x\rightarrow\infty}x\ln\left[1+\frac{1}{2(x-1)}\right]=\lim_{x\rightarrow\infty}x\cdot\frac{1}{2(x-1)}=\frac{1}{2}.\end{aligned}
$$
故曲线的斜渐近线方程为 $ y = x \ln 2 + \frac{1}{2} $.

